@page "/markets/consumer"
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Consumer electronics manufacturing";
    ViewData["Motion"] = "market";
    ViewData["Description"] = "Hana manufactures consumer electronics — smartphone sensor assembly, high-volume SMT and wireless charging modules — precision at consumer volume.";
    ViewData["Canonical"] = "https://www.hanagroup.com/markets/consumer";
}
@section Head {
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="~/css/market-page.css" />
}

<div class="mk-crumbbar"><div class="mk-wrap in"><a href="/markets">Markets</a><span class="sep">&rsaquo;</span><span class="here">Consumer Electronics</span></div></div><section class="mk-hero" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="light" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap mk-hero-in"><div><span class="hero-accent" aria-hidden="true"></span><h1 class="mk-h1">Consumer Electronics Manufacturing and Sensor Packaging</h1><p class="mk-lede">Hana manufactures sensor packages, miniaturized sensor assemblies, high-volume PCBAs and electronic modules used in smartphones, wearables and connected consumer products. Our capabilities extend from OSAT packaging for optical and other sensors through fine-pitch SMT, module assembly and functional test. We also provide complete box-build manufacturing for consumer electronics products.</p><div class="mk-btns"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-primary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Talk to us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a><a href="#products" class="hana-btn hana-btn-secondary" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Product examples</a></div></div><div class="mk-hero-media"><img src="/images/photos/mk-consumer-electronics-card-smt-sensors.webp" alt="Consumer PCBA and packaged sensor assemblies" /></div></div><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-bottom:52px;"><div class="mk-strip"><span class="hana-spec-label" style="flex-shrink:0;">Product examples</span><div class="mk-chips"><span>Smartphone sensors</span><span>Bluetooth audio</span><span>Wearables sensors</span><span>Remote controls</span><span>Smart-home hubs</span><span>Fitness tech</span><span>Wireless chargers</span></div></div></div></section><section class="mk-dark" data-hana-geo="side" data-geo-theme="blue"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div style="max-width:760px;margin-bottom:34px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark">Sensor packaging and electronics manufacturing at consumer volume</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="margin:14px 0 0;">Hana supports consumer programs at component, assembly and finished-product level. Our capabilities cover sensor OSAT packaging, miniaturized sensor assembly, fine-pitch SMT and module manufacturing, as well as complete box build for defined consumer electronic products. Acoustic, Bluetooth, wireless and GPS testing can be integrated into the production flow, with qualified processes available across multiple manufacturing locations to support continuity of supply.</p></div><div class="mk-points"><div class="pt"><div class="t">Precision &amp; flexibility at volume</div><p>Flexible module lines support both high-mix, low-volume programs and low-mix, high-volume production.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Product design and box build</div><p>Industrial design, plastic parts and product packaging developed alongside electronics assembly, supporting complete consumer products through to finished box build.</p></div><div class="pt"><div class="t">Multi-country manufacturing</div><p>Qualified processes are available across our sites in Cambodia, China and Thailand, providing options for dual-source capacity within the Hana group.</p></div></div></div></section><section id="products" data-hana-bg="pcb" data-variant="light" data-fade="none" style="background:#fff;border-top:1px solid var(--line);position:relative;overflow:hidden;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:1;padding-top:64px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:28px;"><h2 class="mk-h2">Product examples</h2></div><div class="mk-cards c2"><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/consumer/smt-sensors"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-consumer-electronics-card-smt-sensors.webp" alt="Consumer PCBA and packaged sensor assemblies" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">SMT &amp; Sensor Assembly</div><p>High-volume SMT and miniaturized sensor assembly for compact consumer electronics, supported by in-line inspection and acoustic, Bluetooth and GPS functional test where required.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a><a class="mk-card" href="/markets/consumer/wireless-charging"><div class="mk-ph"><img src="/images/photos/mk-consumer-electronics-card-wireless-charging.webp" alt="Wireless charging module on the line" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;"/></div><div class="body"><div class="t">Wireless Charging</div><p>Wireless charging modules and coil assemblies manufactured through PCBA, final assembly and functional test, alongside other high-volume consumer electronics programs.</p><span class="more">Explore <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></div></a></div></div></section><section style="background:var(--hana-blue-tint);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:56px;"><div style="max-width:720px;margin-bottom:24px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Where it&#39;s made</h2><p class="mk-body">Consumer electronics programs are supported across Hana sites in Cambodia, China and Thailand. High-volume assembly is concentrated in Cambodia, with consumer LED and electronics manufacturing in China and additional PCBA and box-build capability in Thailand. Programs can be qualified across more than one location where capacity or supply continuity requires it. See <a href="/locations">Locations</a> for plant-level detail.</p></div><div class="mk-locs c4"><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/koh-kong"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Cambodia</span></span><div class="nm">Koh Kong</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/jiaxing"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">China</span></span><div class="nm">Jiaxing</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/ayutthaya"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Ayutthaya</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a><a class="mk-loc" href="/locations/lamphun"><span class="co"><i data-lucide="map-pin" style="width:13px;height:13px;color:var(--hana-blue);"></i><span class="hana-spec-label">Thailand</span></span><div class="nm">Lamphun</div><span class="cta">View plant <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:12px;height:12px;"></i></span></a></div></div></section><section style="background:#fff;"><div class="mk-wrap" style="padding-top:56px;padding-bottom:60px;"><div style="max-width:700px;margin-bottom:22px;"><h2 class="mk-h2 sm">Frequently asked questions</h2><p class="mk-body">Common questions from consumer electronics engineering and procurement teams.</p></div><div style="max-width:860px;"><details class="mk-faq" open><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">What does Hana build for consumer electronics?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana manufactures sensor packages and assemblies, high-volume PCBAs, wireless charging modules and other electronics used inside smartphones, wearables and connected products. We also provide complete box-build manufacturing for consumer electronics such as wireless chargers, fitness electronic products, remote controls, Bluetooth audio products, smart-home hubs, LED lighting and home appliances.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana handle high-volume consumer runs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana&rsquo;s high-volume SMT, assembly and box-build lines support the production volumes and ramp profiles required for consumer sensor assemblies, PCBAs, modules and complete consumer electronic products. Acoustic, Bluetooth, wireless and GPS testing can be integrated into the production flow.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana support both low-volume and high-volume consumer electronics production?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana operates flexible module lines for high-mix, low-volume programs as well as low-mix, high-volume production. The manufacturing approach and line configuration are matched to the product, build complexity, variant mix and required output.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana manufacture complete, box-built consumer electronics?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana can combine PCBA, module assembly, plastic parts, product packaging, final assembly and functional test within a complete box-build program. Examples include wireless chargers, fitness electronic products, remote controls and smart-home hubs.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana manage consumer products with multiple models or configurations?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Flexible assembly and module lines can support product families with different models, configurations or regional variants. The production flow, test coverage and material controls are defined around the mix and volume requirements of the program.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Can Hana combine sensor packaging and electronics manufacturing within one program?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana&rsquo;s capabilities extend from OSAT packaging for optical and other sensors through miniaturized sensor assembly, fine-pitch SMT, module assembly and box build. This allows related packaging and electronics processes to be coordinated within the Hana group.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">How does Hana improve a consumer electronics program after production begins?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Hana continues DFM and VA/VE work throughout the manufacturing relationship. These programs identify opportunities to increase automation, improve production efficiency and support cost and capacity improvements as the product and its volumes develop.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Which sites serve consumer programs?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Consumer work runs across our sites in Cambodia (Koh Kong), China (Jiaxing) and Thailand (Lamphun and Ayutthaya). This provides options for dual-source capacity within the Hana group.</p></details><details class="mk-faq"><summary><span class="mk-faq-mk"><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"></path></svg></span><span style="flex:1;">Does Hana do the miniaturized, dense assembly modern devices need?</span></summary><p class="mk-faq-a">Yes. Hana combines OSAT sensor packaging, microelectronics assembly and fine-pitch SMT to produce compact sensor packages, assemblies and boards for integration into smartphones, wearables and other space-constrained products</p></details></div></div></section><section class="mk-cta" data-hana-bg="flow" data-variant="dark" data-fade="none"><div class="mk-wrap in"><div><h2 class="mk-h2 on-dark" style="max-width:520px;">Start a consumer electronics build program with Hana</h2><p class="mk-body on-dark" style="font-size:16px;max-width:480px;">Tell us about your product, manufacturing requirements and expected volumes. We can identify the appropriate Hana site and process route for your program.</p></div><div class="acts"><a href="/contact" class="hana-btn hana-btn-on-dark" style="padding:12px 22px;font-size:12px;">Contact us <i data-lucide="arrow-right" style="width:14px;height:14px;margin-left:6px;"></i></a></div></div></section>

@section Scripts {
    <script src="~/js/market-sidebar.js"></script>
}
